.TH RIVERXIA 7 "2026-11-25" "Profile-Website" "Developer Manual"
.SH NAME
riverxia \- Profile-Website build system and workflow
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B buck2 run
.I :target
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Profile-Website
is a static site generated by
.I build.py
into
.I dist/
and served by a single Rust backend
.RB ( riverxia-server )
in
.IR server/ .
.PP
All common workflows are exposed as Buck2
.B sh_run
targets defined in
.I BUCK
and
.IR defs.bzl .
.SH TARGETS
.TP
.B buck2 run :check
Run pre-deploy sanity checks
.RI ( scripts/check.py ).
.TP
.B buck2 run :build-site
Build the static sites into
.I dist/
using
.IR "build.py --prod" .
.TP
.B buck2 run :build-server
Build the Rust backend in
.IR server/ .
.TP
.B buck2 run :build
Build both the static site and the Rust backend.
.TP
.B buck2 run :server
Run
.B riverxia-server
locally with
.B LOCAL=1
and
.BR DIST_DIR=../dist .
.TP
.B buck2 run :preview
Rebuild the site with
.B INCLUDE_FUTURE=1
and start
.BR riverxia-server .
.TP
.B buck2 run :test
Run the automated test suite
.RI ( scripts/test_local.py ).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I BUCK
Buck2 target definitions.
.TP
.I defs.bzl
Custom
.B sh_run
and
.B gen_site
Starlark rules.
.TP
.I build.py
Static site generator outputting to
.IR dist/ .
.TP
.I server/
Rust
.RB ( axum " + " rusqlite )
web server.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR riverxia-server (8)
